WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:06.430
Hey Youtubers it’s Charlie and since Arrow
is on break this week I’m doing some bonus

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:08.069
predictions for the rest of the season.

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:15.890
Based on the episode descriptions and behind
the scenes pictures here are at least five

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:18.740
big questions that I’m going to ask and
try to answer in this video.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.220
I’m going to leave a lot of the Season 3
talk for a future video.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.550
So this will just be stuff happening in the
rest of season 2.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:31.409
If you’re finding me for the first time
Wednesday and Thursday are kind of unofficially

00:00:31.409 --> 00:00:32.649
DC days.

00:00:32.649 --> 00:00:37.860
Whenever there’s new episodes I also do
bonus Q&amp;As be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:40.890
Next week is a really cool Flash Crossover.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:45.010
So here are my top 5 questions for the rest
of the season, I’m going to answer these,

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:49.440
but please write your own opinions in the
comments as we go down the list, number 5

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.970
- What is Slade going to do with the Super
Soldier Army?

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:55.480
Not just this season, but what’s he intending
to do with them once their done?

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:57.990
I think the Army is just a means to an end.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:00:59.450
The end of Oliver that is.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:03.700
Slade is trying to tear down Oliver’s life,
and of all the relationships in his life,

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:08.810
his Family and his friends, one of the biggest
is Starling City itself.

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:13.430
Slade could have just killed Oliver by himself,
he didn’t need Brother Blood or Ravager,

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:15.680
who I’m just calling Summer Glau now.

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:19.570
Because he’s all about making Oliver suffer,
he needs to make the city suffer.

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:23.040
So he’s just going to blow up a big part
of the city and kill a lot of people.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:26.800
Basically turn the city into something you’d
see in Grand Theft Auto.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.890
If he’s successful, what’s he planning
on doing with them after?

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:32.930
I don’t think he’s going to use them like
a new League of Assassins, he’s not building

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:34.080
an evil organization.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:37.540
So I think he intends to just walk away when
it’s all done.

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:41.060
He’s a loner, we saw in Episode 18 that
he doesn’t even really care about Brother

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:42.130
Blood.

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:44.170
So he’s just going to disappear again when
it’s all done.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.979
There’s also the chance that he’ll destroy
all the new super soldiers himself.

00:01:47.979 --> 00:01:51.960
They’re convicts, so the arrangement he
made with them, seems very temporary.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:58.950
Like he doesn’t really care if they survive
after his business with Oliver is over.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:03.430
Number 4 - What is Laurel going to do now
that she knows Oliver is the Arrow?

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:08.119
The producers made this really offhanded comment
that audiences are expecting her to freak

00:02:08.119 --> 00:02:11.940
out, but we’ll be surprised when we see
her actual response.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:15.420
I think that just means that Laurel will be
down with it.

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:20.041
She saw a little action during Birds of Prey
and in the description for episode 21 City

00:02:20.041 --> 00:02:23.380
of Blood it says that she’s on the hunt
for Sebastian again.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:27.230
Ever since they started showing her with him
way earlier this season I’ve thought she

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:29.340
might end up being the one to take him down.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:33.620
It’s like you have Oliver versus Slade and
over on the side, you have Laurel taking on

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.709
Brother Blood.

00:02:34.709 --> 00:02:39.610
Now that we know Ravager is a villain I wonder
if Sara will take her on directly or if they’ll

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:41.030
let Felicity do the honors.

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:44.310
There’s all this Laurel Black Canary talk
in the periphery, I still think it’s way

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:46.500
too early for her to become Black Canary.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:51.680
I’m still crossing my fingers that Sara
will survive to next season.

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:56.140
Which brings me to Number 3 - Who Is Going
To Die?

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:59.270
We also should ask, is anyone going to die.

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:03.020
I think so, I just feel like the show has
been escalating things so much, eventually

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:05.920
the only way to top it all will be to kill
a major character.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:09.360
It could totally be a supporting character
like Moira or Merlyn, but think about it this

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.360
way.

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:16.190
Any Characters that are either currently or
will become superheroes are probably safe.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:21.382
But reportedly there was a bunch of extras
on set for episode 21 for a funeral scene.

00:03:21.382 --> 00:03:25.060
No word on who the funeral was for, but I
think that we can consider said funeral to

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:26.510
come after a big character death.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:30.730
Side note though, I will be super bummed if
it all turns out to be misdirection.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:34.489
Like it’s a funeral for a character we didn’t
really see a lot.

00:03:34.489 --> 00:03:39.060
Here’s something else that’s really important
and hopefully it will make you feel better.

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:43.950
Caity Lotz was listed on the call sheet for
episode 22 Streets of Fire.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.130
So Sara will still be alive then.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:47.660
Meaning she’s not going to die.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:50.010
I actually cheered a little when I saw this.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:51.830
So I think she’s going to survive to season
3.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:54.870
Meaning Laurel won’t become Black Canary
yet.

00:03:54.870 --> 00:04:00.260
It also means they can do more Birds of Prey
next season.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:05.700
Amanda Waller has to recruit Huntress at some
point.

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:10.050
on to Number 2 - Will Ivo Turn Out To be Felicity’s
Father?

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:15.400
We still haven’t seen the rest of what happened
on the Island before Oliver took Slade’s

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.400
eye out.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.400
Ivo is also still alive.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:21.449
There are so many things that line up with
what Felicity has said about her father and

00:04:21.449 --> 00:04:24.889
what Ivo has said about himself in all the
Island scenes.

00:04:24.889 --> 00:04:28.070
Andrew Kriesberg said that we would learn
more about Felicity’s backstory in the next

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:31.300
couple of episodes, but they’re holding
a bunch of stuff till season 3.

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:39.850
The only reason they’d do that is if it’s
something really important.

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:45.160
So even if her father isn’t Ivo, he’s
someone very important in the DC Universe.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:49.930
That doesn’t mean he’s evil, but it does
mean the show isn’t going to tell us outright

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.650
who he is.

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:58.350
For now, let’s just stick with Ivo until
we get more details.

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:05.530
and my Number 1 Question - How is Oliver going
to defeat Slade?

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:10.900
We’ve got the description for episode 21
and that’s it.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:15.130
Oliver tries to just flat out surrender to
Slade but it sounds like Team Arrow locks

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:16.610
him up so he can’t.

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:22.229
I also don’t think Slade would stop his
plans just because Oliver surrendered.

00:05:22.229 --> 00:05:24.670
So there are a couple possible solutions.

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:29.120
Oliver could find a way to overpower Slade
and mortally wound him.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:35.780
He’s almost invincible, Slade talking about
how the Mirakuru healed his body proves Oliver

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:38.759
isn’t going to be able to kill him without
chopping his head off.

00:05:38.759 --> 00:05:40.160
Which I don’t think he’s going to do.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:43.700
He’s not a killer, that’s the whole arc
of this season.

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:53.509
He’s not killing people anymore.

00:05:53.509 --> 00:05:59.539
So that opens the door on a bigger threat
coming along like Ra’s Al Ghul.

00:05:59.539 --> 00:06:03.550
Something that would force Slade to stop attacking
Oliver for a minute and make him redirect

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:06.900
his evil energy to the League of Assassins.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:14.500
Manu Bennett kind of teased this, but the
producers said that some special things might

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:15.510
end up happening in the finale.

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:18.950
But they completely depended on a bunch of
stuff working out.

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:23.350
I think they were just talking about wanting
to do Ra’s Al Ghul and Warner Brothers just

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:26.199
had to agree to let them use the character.

00:06:26.199 --> 00:06:31.861
It took a long time for them to get permission
to do Barry Allen and The Flash, so hopefully

00:06:31.861 --> 00:06:36.259
it all worked out and we’ll see Ra’s.

00:06:36.259 --> 00:06:42.930
That would mean Slade and Oliver could temporarily
cease fire and be brothers again so to speak,

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:44.509
while they try to fend of the League.

00:06:44.509 --> 00:06:50.560
That doesn’t really address the issue of
Evil Tinkerbell Shado.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:55.280
I don’t think Oliver will take the Mirakuru
out of Slade’s body, but I do think Team

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:58.220
Arrow will find a way to get rid of evil Shado.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:04.430
I don’t think they’ll kill off Slade,
they didn’t even kill Merlyn.

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:07.390
They’re just to awesome to completely get
rid of.

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:09.810
Plus John Barrowman was on set for the finale.

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:13.110
So Merlyn will play a role in whatever the
final outcome is.

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:18.400
Now it’s your turn though, how do you think
they’ll fix Slade and do you think Moira

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:19.400
is going to die?

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:22.229
Or someone else?

00:07:22.229 --> 00:07:27.570
I’m not doing a Q&amp;A this week, so I’ll
just be answering questions in the comments.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:31.430
Next week is the Flash Crossover though.

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.660
Be sure to subscribe to get my video.

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:38.470
In the meantime learn more about the new Team
Deathstroke here.

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:42.610
And click here to learn more about Captain
America 3.

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:44.450
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:44.461
High Fives!

